## 🔐 Required IAM Permissions

The AWS user/role running this script needs read-only access:

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "ec2:Describe*",
        "s3:ListAllMyBuckets",
        "iam:ListUsers",
        "rds:Describe*",
        "lambda:ListFunctions",
        "eks:ListClusters",
        "ecs:ListClusters",
        "ecr:DescribeRepositories",
        "elasticloadbalancing:Describe*",
        "autoscaling:Describe*",
        "cloudwatch:DescribeAlarms",
        "route53:ListHostedZones",
        "sns:ListTopics",
        "sqs:ListQueues"
      ],
      "Resource": "*"
    }
  ]
}
```

> 💡 **Tip:** Attach `ReadOnlyAccess` AWS managed policy for simplest setup.

